  "description": "AdoScope: lightweight ambient Unit of Work for ADO.NET and Dapper.\nManages DbConnection and DbTransaction lifecycles with clean DI integration,\nnested scopes, multi-context coordination, and optional distributed transactions.\n\nDI lifetime guidance (ASP.NET Core):\n- If IAdoScopeFactory and IAdoContextGroupFactory are singleton (recommended), register AdoScopeOptionsBuilder and IAdoContextOptionsRegistry as singleton too.\n- If configuration objects are scoped, factories must also be scoped.\n- Repositories/services that consume ambient context should remain scoped.\n\nSee README.md for full configuration and usage examples.",
